{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/34af41a42318bf17afec33d5238de594.avif?t=1774250795\" width=1024 height=216 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Retired mercenary? Scammed. Peaceful retirement? Ruined. Your only asset? A haunted tavern with a dimensional portal in the closet.</strong> &gt; <strong>Hunt for 'strange' ingredients in the perils beyond the Rift by day, and serve otherworldly delicacies to survive the night. Rebuild your legacy\u2014before you vanish like the owners before you.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/bb38502ea377577d9fe4f57634f0ab8f.avif?t=1774250795\" width=512 height=18 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;See that guy? That\u2019s the sucker who signed for the 'haunted tavern.'&quot; </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A lifetime\u2019s worth of mercenary retirement funds turned to scrap in an instant.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> While cleaning the dusty shop and fixing a creaky torch bracket, the heavy bookshelf shifted, revealing a mysterious portal glowing with blue light.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> I don\u2019t know if this is the gate to hell or the chance of a lifetime.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> But one thing is for sure: this is a mercenary\u2019s specialty.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/daeb1e745de210583c88258a2715ed8b.avif?t=1774250795\" width=512 height=18 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/c453b126b0af5d93e0ed8f4b8438d9ca.poster.avif?t=1774250795\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/c453b126b0af5d93e0ed8f4b8438d9ca.webm?t=1774250795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/c453b126b0af5d93e0ed8f4b8438d9ca.mp4?t=1774250795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-Explore Unknown Worlds Beyond the Rift!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > From tranquil forests and mysterious mushroom colonies, to even modern convenience stores you could never have imagined! Explore dozens of randomly generated worlds every time you pass through a portal, and collect special ingredients for your tavern.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/992979a3a06cd0c09ebf395c6d43eca8.poster.avif?t=1774250795\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/992979a3a06cd0c09ebf395c6d43eca8.webm?t=1774250795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/992979a3a06cd0c09ebf395c6d43eca8.mp4?t=1774250795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-This Ain't No Simple Management: Defend Your Tavern!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serving food to guests and building your reputation is just the basics. Sometimes you'll have to crack the skulls of rowdy drunks, and other times you'll have to clean up vomit from the floor yourself. This is realistic tavern management!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/4ee95559c7eee647ffa7068624d3369c.poster.avif?t=1774250795\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/4ee95559c7eee647ffa7068624d3369c.webm?t=1774250795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/4ee95559c7eee647ffa7068624d3369c.mp4?t=1774250795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-Create Fantastic Dishes with Otherworldly Ingredients!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new recipes by combining mysterious ingredients brought from the dimensional rifts. From ordinary stews to magical beverages, the dishes born from your hands will decide the fate of your tavern.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/cba27bdd61b96585c10664ade4bc910c.poster.avif?t=1774250795\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/cba27bdd61b96585c10664ade4bc910c.webm?t=1774250795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/cba27bdd61b96585c10664ade4bc910c.mp4?t=1774250795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-Don't Miss Out on Power or Style!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Powerful equipment makes exploring more dangerous dimensions possible. But getting stronger isn't everything. Create your own unique protagonist with hundreds of combinations of outfits, armor, and weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/36c282a95a5be849e6b9a64583746052.poster.avif?t=1774250795\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/36c282a95a5be849e6b9a64583746052.webm?t=1774250795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/36c282a95a5be849e6b9a64583746052.mp4?t=1774250795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-A Living Town and its Neighbors</strong> Rift Tavern is not in an isolated place. Meet the merchants who greet you warmly as you approach their shops, the bustling festival held every weekend, and the neighbors with their own unique personalities who come and go in the town. Sometimes, a peddler selling rare goods might even visit without notice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3902150?t=1774250795","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3902150?t=1774250795","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/eb019fe16df93461b378c5dcda60c47edafa694a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774250795","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/eb019fe16df93461b378c5dcda60c47edafa694a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774250795","categories":[{"descript