b_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/daeb1e745de210583c88258a2715ed8b.avif?t=1774250795\" width=512 height=18 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/c453b126b0af5d93e0ed8f4b8438d9ca.poster.avif?t=1774250795\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/c453b126b0af5d93e0ed8f4b8438d9ca.webm?t=1774250795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/c453b126b0af5d93e0ed8f4b8438d9ca.mp4?t=1774250795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-Explore Unknown Worlds Beyond the Rift!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > From tranquil forests and mysterious mushroom colonies, to even modern convenience stores you could never have imagined! Explore dozens of randomly generated worlds every time you pass through a portal, and collect special ingredients for your tavern.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/992979a3a06cd0c09ebf395c6d43eca8.poster.avif?t=1774250795\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/992979a3a06cd0c09ebf395c6d43eca8.webm?t=1774250795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/992979a3a06cd0c09ebf395c6d43eca8.mp4?t=1774250795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></